name: HRI-4851L(Class A ABP)
description: The HelTec HRI-4851L(Class A ABP) is a RS485-LoRaWAN wireless converter based on ESP32C3 and SX1262. It supports Wi-Fi and LoRaWAN communication. The board has a 35mm din rack rail mount, wide voltage input of DC 4.5~28V, max. TX power of 21±1 dbm and a max. receiving sensitivity	-134dBm .

